63 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 18 0 R
/T (Time series forecasting is performed by identifying a partially known segment within the clusters of a Kohonen network. First, a two-week segment from the test dataset is analyzed. This segment is compared with the weight vectors to determine the most similar cluster. The forecast is based on the values of the selected weight vector from the last week. This allows us to assume that the series will continue to follow the pattern characteristic of the cluster.)
/E (Time series forecasting is performed by identifying a partially known segment within the clusters of a Kohonen network. First, a two-week segment from the test dataset is analyzed. This segment is compared with the weight vectors to determine the most similar cluster. The forecast is based on the values of the selected weight vector from the last week. This allows us to assume that the series will continue to follow the pattern characteristic of the cluster.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [44]
>>
endobj
